  "title": "Ukraine Drone Attack on Oil Refinery in Russia Leaves 13 Dead",
  "summary": "A drone strike on a Russian oil refinery in Nizhnekamsk killed at least 13 people, including a child and eight Central Asian nationals, with Kyiv intensifying its campaign to control Russian territory. The attack is described as part of a broader effort to destabilize the region.",
